# Safe Alert Component

Stateful alert managers that track Safe multisig monitoring conditions and prevent duplicate notifications.

## Key Integration Pattern
Each alert type maintains internal state with mutex protection to ensure thread-safe updates and single-firing alerts for persistent conditions.

## Important Constraints
- Alert types must implement consistent Update() pattern returning shouldAlert bool
- State transitions are idempotent - multiple updates with same condition won't re-trigger alerts
- All alert types use field logger with appropriate context for debugging